<item>
 <title>The Smith family</title>
 <link>https://www.mathon.org.uk/forum/family-history/smith-family</link>
 <description>&lt;p&gt;Hello all, I&#039;ve recently been reseaching my family tree and it turns out they come from Mathon. The family name was Smith. I know this is quite a common name, to say the least. The furthest back&amp;nbsp;I have been able to go is 1841 using the census. The name of the couple is William and Elizabeth Smith. They had a son called James. When we get to the 1851 census James has disappeared but they&#039;ve got 3 more children called William, Eliza and George. Does anybody have any more information on this couple or family?Thank youBen Potter&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
