<item>
 <title>Hickox family</title>
 <link>https://www.mathon.org.uk/forum/family-history/hickox-family</link>
 <description>&lt;p&gt;My grand father was the the youngest son of Ellen Blake ne &lt;strong&gt;Hickox,&lt;/strong&gt; the daughter of Joseph Hickox , Blacksmith from Bosbury and who lived at some time at Horse Hole. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Arthur Harry Blake (my grandfather) married Winnifred May Powell (ne Close) widow of Charles William Powell who was killed in WW1 and is remembered on the memorial. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I gather there were cousins of the Hickox&#039;s in the area. &lt;/p&gt;
